($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 12420204, $f$Опасная привычка$f$, ARRAY[$f$rio_abajo_rio$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Silmarillion and other histories of Middle-Earth - J. R. R. Tolkien$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Финрод очень интересуется человеческой расой. И одним человеком в особенности. А тот, в свою очередь, очень интересуется Финродом.$f$, 730, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-07-31T10:56:35.796+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-31T10:56:35.838+00:00$f$, $f$2017-10-19T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 12420948, $f$Where Hydrangeas Sway On The Wind$f$, ARRAY[$f$adrift_me$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$The Outsider arrives to Dunwall Tower. No words transpire between him and Corvo, and yet the two of them come to a perfect understanding.   They kiss, and the world loses its grip on them for a moment. This time it’s real. This time, there is warmth and truth and reality to how they press lips to each other.$f$, 1276, 1, 1, true, -1, true, $f$2019-07-23T03:40:56.045+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-23T03:40:56.129+00:00$f$, $f$2017-10-19T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 12443853, $f$Muscled shoulders and thick thighs, but you don't want to hear that, do you, girl?$f$, ARRAY[$f$alchemist17$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$I'm not going to list everything involved but I will put the relevant prompt and pairing in bold. Everything is consensual.$f$, 4327, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-07-12T04:57:17.724+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-12T04:57:17.769+00:00$f$, $f$2017-10-25T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 12445200, $f$Unsent$f$, ARRAY[$f$snarechan$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$The Overseers that captured Corvo Attano thought they'd found a direct link to the Outsider and a means to dispose of him forever. They're wrong.$f$, 689, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-07-07T13:56:36.411+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-07T13:56:36.492+00:00$f$, $f$2017-10-21T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
