($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 13015971, $f$Wisps of Golden Light$f$, ARRAY[$f$adrift_me$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Their first night is the longest night. The Void's powers are the strongest ones. And the Outsider's lips so sweet.$f$, 2852, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-06-06T03:25:50.574+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-06T03:25:50.641+00:00$f$, $f$2017-12-14T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 13020321, $f$Wings Over Dunwall$f$, ARRAY[$f$Cannibal_Wings$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Corvo flared his wings and nearly shouted, "And how are these supposed to make my life better?""You misunderstood," The Outsider said, his voice an ever calm even in the storm of emotions. "I never said they would make your life better or easier, only that they would make things much, much more interesting." ---An AU in which The Outsider gifts Corvo a pair of wings and a new threat looms on the horizon.$f$, 47073, 4, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-04-30T21:27:48.835+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-30T21:27:48.869+00:00$f$, $f$2018-07-27T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 13020684, $f$And Into My Room$f$, ARRAY[$f$Assassin_J$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Directly follows the events of "Out Of The Darkness". The Outsider's first day back as a human turns out pretty damn nice.$f$, 3256, 3, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-05-01T11:40:12.837+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-01T11:40:12.877+00:00$f$, $f$2018-01-27T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 13026924, $f$It Might Be Alright If You Go$f$, ARRAY[$f$World_of_Stories19$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Oliver Twist - Charles Dickens$f$, $f$Oliver Twist - All Media Types$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$When Oliver wakes up feeling ill, he hides it from Dodger until his illness causes him to collapse while both boys are out. His high fever worry's Dodger, so much so that Dodger refuses to leave his ill companions bedside. Fagin takes notice of this uncharacteristic behaviour of his protege, and he begins to suspect that there is an underlying feeling to Dodgers worry for Oliver.$f$, 2986, 3, 7, false, 1, false, $f$2019-08-18T03:04:56.830+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-18T03:04:56.876+00:00$f$, $f$2017-12-16T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 13035897, $f$The Lost Lucarno$f$, ARRAY[$f$Sath$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Gentleman Bastard Sequence - Scott Lynch$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$After the death of Father Chains, Jean channels his feelings into writing his own Lucarno. Locke thinks they can sell it for a fortune.In other words, Jean and Locke try to profit off of selling fanfiction, and it goes cockeyed.$f$, 6656, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-06-01T04:40:33.285+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-01T04:40:33.605+00:00$f$, $f$2017-12-25T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
