($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 13044618, $f$Corsets and other Paraphernalia$f$, ARRAY[$f$Prinzenhasserin$f$, $f$Isis$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Gentleman Bastard Sequence - Scott Lynch$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$There's a book Locke wants from a house formerly owned by a bondsmage. The acquiring of said books involves some costumes, and Jean is very distracted.$f$, 6014, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-05-28T03:21:34.343+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-28T03:21:34.421+00:00$f$, $f$2017-12-25T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 13047840, $f$A Bridge/A Chain$f$, ARRAY[$f$Jain$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Think of England - K. J. Charles$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$A job interview, and what comes after.$f$, 1637, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-04-08T11:26:01.993+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-08T11:26:02.257+00:00$f$, $f$2017-12-17T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 13049193, $f$Playacting$f$, ARRAY[$f$ascanios$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Think of England - K. J. Charles$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Honeypots like this aren't Daniel's typical bag, he's not usually up for grabs himself, but he is an excellent operative, a brilliant liar, and a formidable seducer. He managed to lie to the Armstrongs for weeks on end, he can manage to flirt with a murderer for an evening.$f$, 2635, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-03-01T03:40:56.240+00:00$f$, $f$2019-03-01T03:40:56.285+00:00$f$, $f$2017-12-17T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 13060812, $f$
      A Very Corvosider Christmas$f$, ARRAY[$f$Neriad13$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$On the longest night of the year, when the boundary between the Void and reality grows thin, the Outsider walks among us in human form. Bar your doors and lock your windows. Sing so loud that His voice cannot be heard. Feast and be merry - and shut out the gloom.And do not ever even think about letting him in.$f$, 10975, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-06-08T03:13:28.296+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-08T03:13:28.382+00:00$f$, $f$2017-12-19T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, true, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
