($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 13319328, $f$Don’t do me any favors$f$, ARRAY[$f$Nevospitanniy$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Cause every friendly gesture
  
  Turns my stomach inside out
  
  Don't do me any favors
  
  I am better off without
